    Attribute than the targeted monster, by using that Special Summoned monster as
    material. (This is treated as an Xyz Summon.) Then, you can attach 1 card from
    your Deck to that Xyz Summoned monster, with the same name as a "Purrely" Quick-Play
    Spell attached to the targeted monster.
